            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors gives a survey of the various forms of nursing available to elderly people in the district Ceské Budĕjovice, Czechoslovakia. He reports on the various activities of the geriatric nurse there and describes the operation of a nursing system for elderly people suffering from diabetes.</AbstractText>
